(footprint "Buzzer_Huaneng_MLT-8530"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "kigen")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Huaneng MLT-8530 SMD magnetic buzzer, 8.5 x 8.5 x 3.0 mm, side sound port. Land pattern derived from the Huaneng MLT-8530 specification page 2 (Dimensions): corner terminals on an 8.7 mm square, 1.5 mm corner chamfers; + lead top-left, - lead bottom-left, two dummy pads on the sound-port side. The dummy pads are left unconnected: the specification lists 3 terminal plates for 4 corners, so the two dummy corners are probably one plate, and tying them to + and - could short the coil (REVIEW R-01). The drawing does not say whether it is a top or a bottom view; if it is a bottom view the leads land on the dummy pads and the buzzer is silent but undamaged. Check one real part before ordering.")
